  "description": "## [🔥](%E2%8C%9A) [Y]ggdrasil [o]f [U]niverse Rising[🔥](%E2%8C%9A)\n\n**Ancient, wise, always strong,\nHe who follows keeps life long.**\n\n### [✅](%E2%8C%9A)  Join Requirement\n- **Play Active**\n- **Discord Required**\n- **Combat Level min. 100**\n\n### [🚫](%E2%8C%9A) Kick Conditions\n- **Inactive in the Game for 5 Days without notifying leader.**\n- **Not in the Guild Discord**\n\n### [⌚](%E2%8C%9A) Raid Schedule\n- **-**\n\n### [🏊](%E2%8C%9A) Pool Schedule\n- **Every Day:  1 pool  at 10 AM UTC**\n- **Event Weeks: 2 pools daily at 10 AM UTC and 9 PM UTC**\n\n### [⚔️](%E2%8C%9A) Assault Schedule\n- **No fixed date**\n\n### [🎁](%E2%8C%9A)  Guild Benefits\n- **Extensive private data resources on everything, especially combat and dungeons**\n- **In-depth gameplay guides**\n- **Shooting Star &amp; World Boss pings**\n- **Giveaways**\n- **Discord server tag**\n- **Assault buff**\n- **Pool buff**\n- **...and more!**\n\n\n### [❗](%E2%8C%9A) Join NOW !\n\n\n- **Contact a Leader or Officer on Discord to join the guild.**\n\n\n###  [🌐](%E2%8C%9A) discord.gg/98ETEFznCX\n\n**Founded February 4th, 2025**",
